Miguel '''"nitemare"''' Sousa, oldschool [[Portuguese]] player, started playing [[QuakeWorld]] with his classmates back in 1999.
<br />
Favorite game modes are [[2on2]] and [[duel]], in which he has refined his skills and now carries the reputation of a devastating rl/gl aim.

